<figure data-size="column" class="not-prose my-10"><span class="block"><button type="button" data-figure-trigger="true" aria-label="Open image: Localized validation messages" class="block max-w-full cursor-zoom-in text-left outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background w-fit"><span class="relative block overflow-hidden w-fit max-w-full"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 scale-110 bg-cover bg-center blur-lg transition-opacity duration-300 motion-reduce:transition-none" style="background-image:url(https://bosnadev.com/2015/01/29/&quot;data:image/webp;base64,UklGRooAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAADwAACAAAQUxQSDkAAAABYBsAQBKT7tjszv8fBPSEiJgACj5SkH0EPxhbSiGqhPncxntvjleFmOSUUo4xl1RID7KP4BsFHykAVlA4ICoAAACwAQCdASoQAAkAA4BaJaQAAubl7N2gAP72lfZLCBJ0as732Wqr0vAAAAA=&quot;)"></span><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/d41e06a15e8fa73a/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-640x360.avif 640w, https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/70309b9294319f01/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-1200x675.avif 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 848px) 768px, (min-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 80px), calc(100vw - 32px)"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/8152b2729d3526af/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-640x360.webp 640w, https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/d6fd9e02f0c92c04/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-1200x675.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 848px) 768px, (min-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 80px), calc(100vw - 32px)"><img src="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/d6fd9e02f0c92c04/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-1200x675.webp" alt="Localized validation messages" width="1200" height="675" decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="relative block h-auto max-w-full"></picture></span></button></span></figure>
<p>Can you see the problem in the image above? Laravel didn’t translate attribute fields, because we haven’t specify them anywhere. Fortunately, we have a possibility to set custom attributes by providing the fourth argument to the make method:</p>
<div data-code-frame="true" class="not-prose relative my-8 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] py-4 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-syntax-text"><button type="button" class="font-mono text-xs text-syntax-comment transition-colors hover:text-primary absolute top-4 right-3 z-1 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] pl-2">copy</button><pre class="overflow-x-auto font-code"><code class="block w-max min-w-full"><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">$attributes </span><span class="hl-k">=</span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'first_name'</span><span class="hl-k">        =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.first_name'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'last_name'</span><span class="hl-k">         =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.last_name'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'email'</span><span class="hl-k">             =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.email'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'password'</span><span class="hl-k">          =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.password'</span><span class="hl-p">)</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">];</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">$validation </span><span class="hl-k">=</span><span class="hl-c"> Validator</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">make</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-fg">$input</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> $rules</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> $messages</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> $attributes</span><span class="hl-p">)</span><span class="hl-fg">;</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div>
<p>Don’t forget to create <code>app/lang/{locale}/attributes.php</code>:</p>
<div data-code-frame="true" class="not-prose relative my-8 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] py-4 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-syntax-text"><div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-dashed pr-3 pb-3 pl-3 font-mono text-xs"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-syntax-text">app/lang/{locale}/attributes.php</span><span class="text-syntax-comment max-sm:hidden">php · <!-- -->7<!-- --> <!-- -->lines</span><button type="button" class="font-mono text-xs text-syntax-comment transition-colors hover:text-primary ml-auto">copy</button></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto font-code"><code class="block w-max min-w-full"><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-k">return</span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'first_name'</span><span class="hl-k">        =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'Ime'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'last_name'</span><span class="hl-k">         =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'Prezime'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'email'</span><span class="hl-k">             =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'Email'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'password'</span><span class="hl-k">          =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'Lozinka'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'confirm_password'</span><span class="hl-k">  =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'Potvrdite lozinku'</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">];</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div>
<p>Now when you try to submit the form you should have localized error messages as well as attributes:</p>
<figure data-size="column" class="not-prose my-10"><span class="block"><button type="button" data-figure-trigger="true" aria-label="Open image: Laravel localization" class="block max-w-full cursor-zoom-in text-left outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background w-fit"><span class="relative block overflow-hidden w-fit max-w-full"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 scale-110 bg-cover bg-center blur-lg transition-opacity duration-300 motion-reduce:transition-none" style="background-image:url(https://bosnadev.com/2015/01/29/&quot;data:image/webp;base64,UklGRjIAAABXRUJQVlA4ICYAAADQAQCdASoQABAAA4BaJaQAAueFS4U8AAD+9QHKeS6wratNjgAAAA==&quot;)"></span><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/0d8923a81be42b41/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-with-att-640x621.avif 640w, https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/9ab478f25e7623e5/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-with-att-997x967.avif 997w" sizes="(min-width: 848px) 768px, (min-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 80px), calc(100vw - 32px)"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/75b38e917019b443/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-with-att-640x621.webp 640w, https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/316176c93b5196ce/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-with-att-997x967.webp 997w" sizes="(min-width: 848px) 768px, (min-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 80px), calc(100vw - 32px)"><img src="https://media.bosnadev.com/hub/316176c93b5196ce/2015-01-laravel-validation-localized-messages-with-att-997x967.webp" alt="Laravel localization" width="997" height="967" decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="relative block h-auto max-w-full"></picture></span></button></span></figure>
<p>Another way to set custom attributes is by using setAttributeNames method on a Validator instance:</p>
<div data-code-frame="true" class="not-prose relative my-8 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] py-4 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-syntax-text"><button type="button" class="font-mono text-xs text-syntax-comment transition-colors hover:text-primary absolute top-4 right-3 z-1 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] pl-2">copy</button><pre class="overflow-x-auto font-code"><code class="block w-max min-w-full"><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">$attributes </span><span class="hl-k">=</span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'first_name'</span><span class="hl-k">        =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.first_name'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'last_name'</span><span class="hl-k">         =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.last_name'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'email'</span><span class="hl-k">             =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.email'</span><span class="hl-p">),</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-se">    'password'</span><span class="hl-k">          =></span><span class="hl-c"> Lang</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">get</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-se">'attributes.password'</span><span class="hl-p">)</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">];</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">$validation </span><span class="hl-k">=</span><span class="hl-c"> Validator</span><span class="hl-k">::</span><span class="hl-f">make</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-fg">$input</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> $rules</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> $messages</span><span class="hl-p">)</span><span class="hl-fg">;</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">$validation</span><span class="hl-k">-></span><span class="hl-f">setAttributeNames</span><span class="hl-p">(</span><span class="hl-fg">$attributes</span><span class="hl-p">)</span><span class="hl-fg">;</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div>
<p>And that’s it. Now you know how you can perform simple validation, localize your error messages and set custom attributes. In the next article, I’ll cover model and service level data validation.</p>
